The Blues Brothers (MS-DOS) translation and smooth-scroll project
==============================================================

1. Project code — MIT License

The project-authored code in tools/, tests/ and mods/ is covered by the MIT
License. This includes apply_patch.py, bbformats.py, the START.COM launcher
source in mods/launcher/, and the smooth-scroll assembler and patching code
in mods/smooth_scroll/, including its relocation changes. Compiled forms of
this project-authored code distributed in the patch are covered as well.
This license does not apply to the original game's code or third-party
TDT/TRSI material.

